<topic template="Default" modified="2026-11-17T13:30:54.138+01:00" lasteditedby="robert" version="2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title>SET BLOCKSIZE 命令</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET BLOCKSIZE command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">SET BLOCKSIZE 命令</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">指定如何为备注字段的存储分配磁盘空间。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">SET BLOCKSIZE TO &lt;nBytes&gt;</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">&lt;nBytes&gt;<tab/>备注块的大小。介于 1 和 32 之间的值表示 512 字节块的数量。更大的值表示字节数。值 0 选择 1 字节的块。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">备注</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">该设置在创建带有备注字段的新表时使用。该命令等同于 <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_MEMOBLOCK">SET MEMOBLOCKSIZE</link>。</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_MEMOBLOCK">SET MEMOBLOCKSIZE</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_CREATE_TABLE">CREATE TABLE</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
